# ISO 27001 Compliance Assessment & Remediation Program

## Project Overview

Conducted an ISO 27001:2022 compliance assessment for a fictional financial services organization operating in a Microsoft 365 and Azure cloud environment.

## Organization Profile

- Organization: ABC Financial Services
- Industry: Financial Services
- Employees: 250
- Environment: Microsoft 365, Microsoft Azure

## Assessment Scope

- Identity & Access Management
- Cloud Security
- Vendor Risk Management
- Compliance & Audit
- Incident Response
- Vulnerability Management
- Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery

## Activities Performed

- ISO 27001 Control Assessment
- Compliance Gap Analysis
- Security Control Evaluation
- Risk Identification
- Remediation Planning
- Executive Compliance Reporting

## Key Findings

- 15 Controls Assessed
- 9 High-Risk Gaps Identified
- 6 Medium-Risk Gaps Identified
- Current Compliance Score: 72%
- Target Compliance Score: 95%

## Deliverables

- Executive Summary
- Gap Assessment Register
- Remediation Roadmap
- Compliance Reporting Dashboard

## Frameworks Used

- ISO 27001:2022
- NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF)
- CIS Controls

